    "detailed_description": "<h1>Get Free Access Key!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531200/extras/8bce56cad968aaa268628c70c8dddc0b.avif?t=1754921018\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Visit the steam discussions to apply for your free key (you must own a copy of the app).</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531200/extras/934b04d11e4b14895baa0dbd0af25322.avif?t=1754921018\" data-has-big width=800 height=368 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is\u00a0Forever Epic Story?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forever Epic Story is a Hip Hop/Pop group with a unique style and blend of melodic hooks, strong rap vocals and bass driven beats. Each song delivers a different story and tale to captivate and stimulate the imagination of the listener. Prepare to enter an epic journey into a world of creative sound and thought provoking lyrics. A never ending tale of inspiration, courage and fortitude, your Forever Epic Story now begins\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is included with this application?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This application is an interactive music album including, exploration map, group bio, videos with sing along lyrics and 12 audio MP3 singles from the group's  album. Enter into a forever epic adventure and explore the map, music, music videos and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Music Tracks are Included for Download?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c 1. <strong>Open Up Your Eyes</strong> [Music Download, Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c 2. <strong>After All Said and Done</strong>\u00a0[Music Download, Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c 3. <strong>Reality (Begin to Believe)</strong>\u00a0[Music Download, Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 4.\u00a0<strong>Transcend Through Time</strong>\u00a0[Music Download, Music Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 5. <strong>Where People Know Me</strong>\u00a0[Music Download, Music Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c\u00a06. <strong>Blew Waters</strong>\u00a0[Music Download, Music Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c 7. <strong>Angels Up Above (Eternity)</strong>\u00a0[Music Download,\u00a0 Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 8. <strong>Far Above and Beyond</strong>\u00a0[Music Download, Music Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c 9. <strong>This is My Prayer</strong>\u00a0[Music Download, Music Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c 10. <strong>All Soldiers And Knights</strong>\u00a0[Music Download, Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 *BONUS TRACK:\u00a0<strong>Time to Be a Hero</strong>\u00a0[Music Download, Music Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 *BONUS TRACK:\u00a0<strong>Strider (No Hating on Me)</strong>\u00a0[Music Download, Music Video with Lyrics]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
